一部，行田時吹之。」興世素恭謹畏法憲，譬之曰：「此是天子鼓角，非田舍老公所吹。」興世欲拜墓，仲子謂曰：「汝衞從太多，先人必當驚怖。」興世減撤而後行。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0005","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0001","source_term":"父仲子"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"張興世傳尾具名父仲子，南史同。"}},{"id":"ykp_uqh_6be_AA","label":"張欣業（宋書記當嗣張興世爵）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"欣業","mention_ids":["c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001:m0003"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001:m0003","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye","quote":"欣業"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"宋書與殿本作欣業。南史記子欣泰及其兄欣華、弟欣時，未確定欣業與此三人關係。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"ykp_uqh_6be_A","source_assertion_id":"a-song050-xinye-xingshi","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-050","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye","source_id":"s-songshu-050-zhang-xinye-ws2371899","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001","quote":"興世子欣業，當嗣封，會齊受禪，國除。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001:m0000","source_term":"興世子欣業"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"宋書與殿本明記興世子名欣業。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-songshu-050-zhang-xinye-ws2371899","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-050","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001:m0003"],"paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001:m0003","mention_ids":["c-songshu-050-zhang-xinye:p001:m0003"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"pa